# Do not rebuild the dataset

Never run `python scripts/build_dataset.py` or `python3 scripts/build_dataset.py`.

`data/messianic-prophecies.json` is the source of truth. It has been edited by hand:

- Duplicate Konig rows were dropped
- Verse `text` may include `__underline__` markup
- Verse `text` may be shortened with `…`

The build script overwrites that file from the live chart plus KJV and would wipe those edits.

Edit `data/messianic-prophecies.json` (and `data/messianic-prophecies.config.json`) directly. Only run the build script if the user explicitly asks and accepts that hand edits will be lost.
